Statement of changes
--------------------
Vigilance modifies Bruce. The main changes are:

- A new framebuffer-based user interface ("Sentinel HUD"): full-screen sprite
  rendering with anti-aliased primitives, a live-radar home screen, restyled
  menus, a lock-on boot animation, and a standby / screensaver scene.
- Defensive-surveillance features added or reworked, including Bug Sweep,
  BLE anti-tracker Watch, Tail Watch, Sub-GHz Census, an on-device Journal,
  Guardian Eye / Sentinel Pulse, and a Swarm (ESP-NOW) mode.
- User-facing strings, on-device folder names, and default identifiers changed
  from "Bruce" to "Vigilance".
- Input handling fixes for the T-Embed CC1101 Plus (latched back-button, encoder
  navigation).

